# Weapon-class pictures (D339)

One picture per weapon CLASS, shown in AI Scripts (auto-actions.js) on every
game's class heading only. A weapon's row never shows it (a row shows its own
gun or its class code). The same picture is used for every game (the owner, 2026-10-14: "even
if it's Apex Legends show an AR from Call of Duty").

**Nothing new was downloaded.** Each file is a copy of a weapon picture the app
already ships in `game-data/cod-warzone/weapons/`, cropped to the weapon,
scaled to fit 240 x 100 pixels and saved as a 128-colour PNG
(scratch script, not kept: PIL crop to alpha, LANCZOS thumbnail, FASTOCTREE
quantize). The provenance is the source file's own row in
`game-data/cod-warzone/SOURCES.md`: Activision's artwork from
imgs.callofduty.com, used only to identify the weapon (D116, the same accepted
risk). These pictures live in the app only; no image bytes go to the Core.

