## Classes left as words

Bows (Fortnite's only bow pictures sit on a coloured card, not a cut-out),
Shields, Special, Items, Gadget weapons, Agent weapons, and every group that is
not a weapon class (operators, legends, heroes, agents, modes) keep their
short code chip.

Why the Fortnite Pump Shotgun is not the shotgun picture, though the owner
offered it: every Fortnite picture in `game-data/fortnite/weapons/` is a
rarity card with an orange or blue background, so on a class heading it reads
as a box, not a gun. All eleven pictures are transparent cut-outs, so they sit
on the same pool of light in both themes.
